window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Julian Harrow and Christian Thorne are now Vampires! And both young men have been united with their Masters after trials and tribulations. But if they thought that becoming Vampires was dangerous and exciting, being the fledglings of the exiled Lord Balthazar Ravenscroft and the Vampire King Daemon will blow that out of the water. Because both Balthazar and Daemon have enemies that are intent on making sure that they and their new fledglings are given their Second Deaths.</p> <p>NOTE: This is a serial that has been cut into book-length formats. There are cliffhangers at the end of every book. Narrated by a full cast: Edward Fox with Adam Riley, Chris Walters, Jay Thelyss, Hannah Hart, Francesca Bianchi, Vanessa Porter, Liz Gentle, Bran Lemieux, Matthew Bissett, and Forrest Smith.</p>"; 
